## Global State

Three principal state objects are defined in `index.html` and accessed across all modules:

**`library`**
```
rootHandle   — { name, _path } in Tauri; FileSystemDirectoryHandle in FSAPI mode
items        — array of series objects: { name, path, chapters, coverUrl, size, muInfo }
curSeries    — the currently open series object, or null
curChIdx     — index into curSeries.chapters of the open chapter
```

**`reader`**
```
pages        — array of page objects: { name, url, revoke, filePath?, pdfDoc?, pdfPageNum? }
curPage      — current page index
spread       — two-page spread active
strip        — long strip mode active
rtl          — right-to-left reading direction
zoom         — current zoom multiplier
src          — always 'local'
panX, panY   — pixel offsets for zoom-and-pan
```

**`ui`**
```
activeView      — the currently visible .view element
activeTab       — 'library' or 'bookmarks'
currentView     — string ID of the active view ('landing'|'library'|'chapters'|'reader')
navHistory      — stack for forward navigation
chSortAsc       — chapter list sort direction
activeGenres    — Set of genre strings for filter
libSort         — library sort key ('az'|'za'|'size-asc'|etc.)
selectMode      — multi-select mode active
selectedSeries  — Set of series names currently selected
```

`userSettings` (in `settings.js`) holds the four persisted preferences: direction, layout, theme, density.

