## Startup Sequence

The `init()` async IIFE runs after all scripts have loaded:

1. `loadAllData()` — reads all JSON files from disk in parallel via `Promise.allSettled`
2. Store variables are assigned from `_store` (`bookmarks`, `muOverrides`, `readProgress`, `coverIndex`, etc.)
3. `_initMuCache()` — populates `muCache` with eviction
4. `initSettings()` — reads `settings.json`, applies theme, density, fonts, restores custom theme if active
5. Event handlers and logo click are wired up
6. `show('landing')` — landing view is displayed
7. Version is resolved from the Tauri backend via `window.__TAURI__.app.getVersion()`
8. Silent update check fires in the background
9. `load_library_path` is called; if a saved path exists, `_loadLibraryFromPath()` runs and the library opens automatically

